invariant: INV-4
file: srv_kex.c
catches: test/lint-invariants.sh
reason: encapsulate draws the ML-KEM randomness from ch_rand_bytes rather
  than through rand_draw, the one draw path. Under RAND=extern the bytes
  come from the same hook, so no test of that build notices, and under
  RAND=session the object would import a hook no image defines.
  inv-4-one-draw-path refuses a ch_rand_bytes call outside rand_draw's
  body.

--- old
    rand_draw(&h->t->cfg, m, sizeof m);
--- new
    ch_rand_bytes(m, sizeof m);
